#: ../../source/docs/autotune-mode.rst:5 9f6bc656fb1d448fa776da8a6c5e6499
msgid "AUTOTUNE Mode"
msgstr "AUTOTUNE 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/autotune-mode.rst:7 d8312a6d5f8541e9b2fce034c644a6eb
msgid ""
"The AUTOTUNE mode flies in the same way as :ref:`FLY BY WIRE_A (FBWA) <fbwa-"
"mode>`, but it does automatic tuning of roll and pitch control gains. Please"
" read the :ref:`full documentation on AUTOTUNE <automatic-tuning-with-"
"autotune>` for more details."
msgstr ""
"AUTOTUNE 模式的飞行方式与 :ref:`线传飞行_A (FBWA) <fbwa-mode>` 相同，但会自动调参横滚和俯仰控制增益。请阅读 "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE 完整文档 <automatic-tuning-with-autotune>` 了解更多详情。"
